# LOCAL DEMO ONLY — not production.
# Runtime copy is gitignored. compose-up copies this file if the runtime env is missing.
# Do not put production secrets, Google Maps keys, or non-demo passwords here.
# Local demo defaults for app containers (NOT for production).
